  m_text: To activate teleport mode with hand tracking, curl the fingers of your
    right hand in with your palm facing up while keeping your index finger and thumb
    extended out. Aim the teleport ray to the desired location using any hand orientation
    that is comfortable for you, then pinch to start teleporting. You can hold the
    pinch and drag your hand in a circle to choose the direction you'll face. Release
    the pinch to teleport. Release the curl to stop teleport mode.
